Minimum Qualifications * Current student in an engineering or related degree program; graduation date not before September 2027! * Understanding of SPC and Design of Experiments! * Proficiency in one or more scripting/programming tools (Python, Java) and visualization tools (Tableau, Matlab, Microsoft Suite). * Ability to commit to 40 hours/week during Summer 2026 and 20 hours/week part-time during Fall 2026/Spring 2027. ### you have listed in your resume or application materials. The Platform will assign a match score based on how closely your stated and inferred skills match the requirements for the open role based on the content of your application, the Platform&rsquo;s analysis described above and Micron&rsquo;s configuration of the skill and AI qualification matching software. While this match score may influence which applications receive prioritized attention from recruiters, it does not automatically determine hiring outcomes. Such decisions are always made by Micron recruiters. These unique features of the Platform help us ensure that we don&rsquo;t miss what you have to offer based on the skills we are looking for. They also support our efforts to eliminate bias in the recruitment process. If your application is unsuccessful, we will keep your information so our recruiters can match you with future roles, and contact you if they think you may be a fit for open positions. Regardless of any AI assistance in the recruitment process, Micron recruiters use their professional judgment to make all decisions regarding whether to advance candidates in the hiring process. Micron recruiters do not solely relying on match scores. If you have any questions about this Notice, including Micron&rsquo;s deployment of AI systems as part of its recruiting efforts or to request a reasonable accommodation, please contact us as follows: A. Via Email. You may contact us by email at privacy@micron.com . B. Via Telephone. You may also contact us by telephone at +1-800-336-8915. C. Via Direct Mail. You may contact us by direct mail at: Micron Technology, Inc. Attn: Legal-Privacy 8000 South Federal Way Post Office Box 6 Boise, Idaho 83707-0006, USA Additional Information for Applicants Applying to Roles in the EU and/or Those Applying from the EU This specific section applies to applications for roles located in the EU and/or to candidates applying from the EU. It explains how Micron uses an AI system in recruitment and the safeguards we apply in accordance with the EU AI Act. Type of AI Technology: Micron uses the Eightfold AI recruiting software, a machine-learning talent-intelligence platform that uses natural-language processing to parse resumes, infer candidate skills and calculate compatibility scores with open positions. Since it is used to support recruitment and selection decisions, this tool is treated as a "high-risk" AI system under the EU AI Act&rsquo;s Annex covering employment-related AI uses. The Purpose for Which It Is Used: The Eightfold AI recruiting software is used to: (a) identify skills from your resume and career history; (b) match your qualifications against role requirements; (c) highlight applications that may be strong fits for recruiter review; and (d) recommend other open positions you may wish to consider. Impact on Employment Decisions: The Eightfold AI recruiting software generates matching scores and skill inferences. AI outputs are decision-support only. Micron recruiters - trained to exercise independent judgment and avoid automation bias - review applications and make all decisions to interview, hire or reject. We do not automatically reject any candidate based solely on AI analysis, and every application routed through the Platform is reviewed by a human recruiter. Information and rights: If you prefer not to have your application processed using the AI-assisted tools described above, you may submit your resume directly to TA_EMEA@micron.com along with the Req Id number listed in the job description. Your resume will be forwarded to the appropriate recruiter for review without the use of the Eightfold AI recruiting software. You may lodge a complaint with the competent national market surveillance authority under the EU AI Act, and you retain all rights under EU data protection law (see Micron&rsquo;s Applicant Privacy Notice ). You may also contact us directly with questions about this Notice or about how the Eightfold AI recruiting software was used in connection with your application by using the contact information provided above. ", "privacy": {"defaultLoggedOutContactConsent": null, "defaultLoggedOutCampaignConsent": null}, "customPageSections": {"footer": "", "customNavbarConfig": {"enable": true, "html": " Candidate Home Students Events Join Talent Network Global Idaho Mexico New York Virginia University Recruiting US Veterans GET MATCHED ", "css": ".a-link{color:#bd03f7!important}.position-details{display:-webkit-box;display:-moz-box;display:box;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;-moz-box-orient:vertical;box-orient:vertical}.position-details>div:nth-of-type(4){-webkit-box-ordinal-group:13}.position-details>div:nth-of-type(5){-webkit-box-ordinal-group:10}.position-details>div:nth-of-type(5){-webkit-box-ordinal-group:11}.position-details>div:nth-of-type(7){-webkit-box-ordinal-group:12}.join-tn-link1 a{color:#fff;border:2px solid #fff;padding:2% 10% 2% 10%;font-weight:bold} .linkholder .header-search-btn{display:none!important}.jumbotron{display:none} #navbar-section .navholder{background:#000000}.get-matched-button>span{font-size:0;vertical-align:sub}.get-matched-button>span:after{font-size:13px;content:'GET MATCHED'}.position-apply-button{background:#009d85!important;border-color:#fff!important;.position-apply-button:hover{color:##009d85!important}}.apply-form{background:white!important;min-height:500px!important;padding-top:12%!important}.hero-image{background-size:initial!important;height:560px!important;margin-top:6%!important;background-position:center center!im